## ComponentObservation

### DESCRIPTION

Evidence-bearing observation of one component profile. Source identity, kind, selected version, freshness, and checksum remain attributable and are not silently merged with another source.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| sourceId | ComponentSourceId | 1 |
| sourceKind | InformationSourceKind | 1 |
| evidenceLocation | ComponentReferenceUri | 1 |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| freshness | InformationSourceFreshness | 1 |
| observedAt | CatalogRefreshTime | ? |
| expiresAt | CatalogRefreshTime | ? |
| artifactChecksumSha256 | ArtifactChecksumSha256 | ? |
| diagnostics | CbdWarning | * |

